{"journal_version":1,"sequence":9,"replace_from":10,"message_count":11,"messages":[{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"ghost variant exists — borderless, no shadow. Good. Verify passed already. Done.","content":"Change landed and verified.\n\n**Change** (`app/page.tsx`, rightmost column toolbar):\n- Wrapped toolbar already had `sticky top-0`; kept it and added `z-10` so it stays above scrolled content.\n- All five toolbar buttons switched from `variant=\"outline\"` (bordered + shadow) to `variant=\"ghost\"` (borderless, background-free, hover only) — confirmed `ghost` is a defined variant in `components/ui/button.tsx`.\n- Removed inter-button spacing and dividers: `space-x-4` → `space-x-0`, dropped each wrapper's `border-r`/`pr-4`/`px-4`, so buttons sit flush next to each other like a Mac toolbar.\n- Toolbar options unchanged (Mail, Trash, Reply, Forward, Search), with Search still right-aligned via `ml-auto`.\n\n**Commands run:**\n- `npm run verify:agent` → exit 0, \"render smoke passed: HTTP 200, 27298 bytes\"\n\n**Remaining risks:** Sticky positioning depends on the parent scroll container (`w-12/20` column); the render smoke only confirms the page renders, not scroll behavior. The `z-10` could overlap a dialog/popover if one is opened from elsewhere in this column with a lower stacking context.","response_items":[{"id":"77055c97-60af-47c8-88f3-072c3d81c216","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","content":[{"text":"ghost variant exists — borderless, no shadow. Good. Verify passed already. Done.","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":"d8bb6869-ab59-47ff-8d44-7094c11e1f09-0","status":"completed"},{"id":"ad80393f-f12b-4cd8-8e42-42c02797d094","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"Change landed and verified.\n\n**Change** (`app/page.tsx`, rightmost column toolbar):\n- Wrapped toolbar already had `sticky top-0`; kept it and added `z-10` so it stays above scrolled content.\n- All five toolbar buttons switched from `variant=\"outline\"` (bordered + shadow) to `variant=\"ghost\"` (borderless, background-free, hover only) — confirmed `ghost` is a defined variant in `components/ui/button.tsx`.\n- Removed inter-button spacing and dividers: `space-x-4` → `space-x-0`, dropped each wrapper's `border-r`/`pr-4`/`px-4`, so buttons sit flush next to each other like a Mac toolbar.\n- Toolbar options unchanged (Mail, Trash, Reply, Forward, Search), with Search still right-aligned via `ml-auto`.\n\n**Commands run:**\n- `npm run verify:agent` → exit 0, \"render smoke passed: HTTP 200, 27298 bytes\"\n\n**Remaining risks:** Sticky positioning depends on the parent scroll container (`w-12/20` column); the render smoke only confirms the page renders, not scroll behavior. The `z-10` could overlap a dialog/popover if one is opened from elsewhere in this column with a lower stacking context.","type":"output_text","logprobs":[]}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":"final_answer"}],"timestamp":"2026-11-22T14:43:49.930007+00:00"}],"meta":{"snapshot_version":1,"aid":0,"role":"workflow_agent","model":"deepseek-flash","session_state":{"used_tokens":14118,"context_tokens":3542,"step_count":5,"markup_recovered":0,"recent_call_hashes":["4d9c212abc3338a9b2fa8c77613bbd58","4085ea9def5e32f10ec2c8637f22ad2e","3c45d71dcb1acaddc13d0e86e5418077","92d186a6b5e7f0dcb1fc2b321d0fafcb"],"reads_since_last_edit":1,"has_landed_write":true,"low_yield_since_progress":0,"distinct_evidence_count":4,"scout_ledger":[{"tool":"file_read","target":"app/page.tsx","outcome":"hit","snippet":"File: app/page.tsx (300 lines total, showing 63-90) 63 <div className=\"col-span-2 flex flex-col w-12/20\"> 64 <div className=\"flex items-center space-x-4 border-b border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-800 p-4 sticky top-0 bg-white dark:bg-zinc-90"},{"tool":"file_write","target":"app/page.tsx","outcome":"hit","snippet":"Replaced in app/page.tsx: 1161 chars → 952 chars (content changed)"},{"tool":"verify_frontend","target":"{}","outcome":"hit","snippet":"Exit code: 0 > my